      "label": "Satirical Juxtaposition",
      "description": "The use of contrasting images or concepts to create humor or commentary, often highlighting irony or absurdity. In this meme, the juxtaposition of genuine grief with the man’s amused reaction satirizes the detachment of internet culture.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_88e20c40"
