      "label": "genuine grief is mapped onto 'normal people after a tragedy'",
      "description": "The top image, showing a group of people visibly grieving, is explicitly labeled by the text 'normal people after a tragedy'. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual depiction of genuine grief is identified as representing 'normal people after a tragedy'.",
