      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the man smiling at laptop",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the bottom image who is smiling while looking at a laptop, as indicated by the text 'me: oh man these memes are going to be fucking great'. The deictic pronoun 'me' explicitly links the user to this character, projecting the user's anticipated reaction onto this visual entity.",
