      "description": "The meme is designed for individuals who are familiar with and participate in internet meme culture, particularly those who understand the phenomenon of creating and circulating memes in response to real-world tragedies. The humor and satire rely on the audience's recognition of how internet culture often commodifies or trivializes suffering for entertainment or virality.",
